// step, imports only from the SDK and React. Data comes from the agent half's
// dashboard/plugin_api.py through ctx.rest. Fonts: Chakra Petch (OFL), embedded
// by tools/embed-fonts.py between the FONTS markers below. Do not hand-edit that block.
